<title>FINLAND: Rauma says not hit as Diamond Cruise folds.</title>
<headline>Rauma says not hit as Diamond Cruise folds.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINMI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy said in a statement on Wednesday that the bankruptcy of  Diamond Cruise Oy would not have any significant impact on Rauma's 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>Rauma said it owns 15 percent of Diamond Cruise. The value of Rauma's shareholding and receivables relating to the company totalled 20 million markka, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;Not even in the worst case will the bankruptcy have any significant effect on Rauma's earnings this year,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
